{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "GAL",
  "chapter": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Paul, an apostle, (not from men, neither by man, but by Jesus Christ, and God the Father, who raised him from the dead;)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And all the brethren who are with me, to the churches of Galatia:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grace ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to you and peace from God the Father, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our Lord Jesus Christ,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who gave himself for our sins, that he might deliver us from this present evil world, according to the will of God and our Father:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To whom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory for ever and ever. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I marvel that ye are so soon removed from him that called you into the grace of Christ, to another gospel:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which is not another; but there are some that trouble you, and would pervert the gospel of Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But though we, or an angel from heaven, should preach any other gospel to you than that which we have preached to you, let him be accursed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As we said before, so I say now again, If any ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " preacheth any other gospel to you than that ye have received, let him be accursed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For do I now persuade men, or God? or do I seek to please men? for if I yet pleased men, I should not be the servant of Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I certify you, brethren, that the gospel which was preached by me is not according to man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I neither received it from man, neither was I taught ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", but by the revelation of Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye have heard of my manner of life in time past in the Jews' religion, that beyond measure I persecuted the church of God, and wasted it;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And profited in the Jews' religion above many my equals in my own nation, being more exceedingly zealous of the traditions of my fathers.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But when it pleased God, who separated me from my mother's womb, and called ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by his grace,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To reveal his Son in me, that I might preach him among the heathen; immediately I conferred not with flesh and blood:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither did I go to Jerusalem to them who were apostles before me: but I went into Arabia, and returned again to Damascus.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then after three years I went to Jerusalem to see Peter, and abode with him fifteen days.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I saw no other of the apostles, save James the Lord's brother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now the things which I write to you, behold, before God, I lie not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Afterwards I came into the regions of Syria and Cilicia;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And was unknown by face to the churches of Judea which were in Christ:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But they had heard only, That he who persecuted us in times past, now preacheth the faith which once he destroyed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GAL.1.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GAL.1.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they glorified God in me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
